// ---------------------------------------------------------------- Phase 2
//
// ponytail: these tables carry plain FK columns and no Prisma relation fields,
// exactly as docs/src/p2_data_model.md specifies them. users already holds
// forty relations; adding a back-relation per Phase 2 table would put every
// module's migration in the same model and slow client generation for a join
// most reads do not need. Services stitch display names through
// common/helpers/user-lookup.helper.ts, which exists for that.
// Upgrade path: add @relation per table if a module genuinely needs nested
// writes, which nothing in Phase 2 does.

